{"product_id":"lionboy-the-truth","title":"Lionboy: The Truth","description":"\u003cp\u003eCharlie Ashanti – lion-rescuer, shipwreck-survivor and Catspeaker – is safe with his parents. Or is he?Old enemies are closing in: Maccomo, the liontrainer, longs for revenge, and the evil Corporacy is still hunting Charlie and his mum and dad.They could hide. But the time to hide is over. Now is the time to fight back . . .Brilliantly written, fantastically exciting adventure fiction with a twist – boys and girls aged 9+ will love it!Lionboy was the first ever selection by the Blue Peter Book Club.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Zizou Corder\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141317571\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45788200665241,"sku":"16RD-19780141317571","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ecd119e570b_Lionboy-_The_Truth_Zizou_Corder.jpg?v=1760372317","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/lionboy-the-truth","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}